*select* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''select(readFds, writeFds, timeoutMs)''

Waits for I/O readiness on multiple handles with timeout.

*Parameters:*
- ''readFds'': List of file handles to monitor for reading
- ''writeFds'': List of file handles to monitor for writing  
- ''timeoutMs'': Number timeout in milliseconds (0 = no timeout)

*Returns:*
- List: Handles ready for I/O (read-ready and write-ready handles combined)
- List: Empty list on timeout
- ''err'' on system call failure

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if readFds or writeFds is not a list
- Runtime error if handle elements are not numbers
- Runtime error if handles are invalid (file/socket/process)
- Runtime error if file descriptors exceed system limits
